{"id":"the-canyon","name":"The canyon","type":"location","aliases":["canyon floor"],"description":"The canyon with bluffs where the Mardu ambush Kolaghan's brood.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2015-01-28","last_seen":"2015-01-28","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e0","summary":"Alesha leads the Mardu horde in an ambush of six dragons from Kolaghan's brood in a canyon.","participants":["alesha-who-smiles-at-death","mardu","kolaghan-s-brood"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"major","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":11,"quote":"Her arrow struck the first one in the mouth, sending a stray bolt of lightning harmlessly to the ground.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=Her%20arrow%20struck%20the,harmlessly%20to%20the%20ground.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=Her%20arrow%20struck%20the,harmlessly%20to%20the%20ground.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e1","summary":"Mardu warriors drop from a bluff onto the swerving dragon and two drive swords deep into its flesh.","participants":["mardu","kolaghan-s-brood"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"minor","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":12,"quote":"But two Mardu—two who would be celebrated this night—drove swords into its flesh","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=But%20two%20Mardu%E2%80%94two%20who,swords%20into%20its%20flesh","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=But%20two%20Mardu%E2%80%94two%20who,swords%20into%20its%20flesh","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e2","summary":"A dragon's lightning breath terrifies Alesha, recalling the scars on her back from an earlier dragon, and she leaps from her horse.","participants":["alesha-who-smiles-at-death","kolaghan-s-brood","kolaghan"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"minor","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":14,"quote":"a memory of past terror, when another spawn of Kolaghan's brood had given her the scars she wore on her back.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=a%20memory%20of%20past,wore%20on%20her%20back.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=a%20memory%20of%20past,wore%20on%20her%20back.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e3","summary":"A towering nameless orc stuns a dragon but holds back instead of killing it, and Gedruk Wingbreaker delivers the killing blow.","participants":["gedruk-wingbreaker","mardu","kolaghan-s-brood"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"minor","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":23,"quote":"It was Gedruk Wingbreaker who ran forward and hacked at the creature's neck before it could regain its balance.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=It%20was%20Gedruk%20Wingbreaker,could%20regain%20its%20balance.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=It%20was%20Gedruk%20Wingbreaker,could%20regain%20its%20balance.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e4","summary":"Alesha confronts the orc about holding back; he insults her as a human boy who thinks he is a woman.","participants":["alesha-who-smiles-at-death"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"major","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":34,"quote":"A human boy who thinks he's a woman?","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=A%20human%20boy%20who%20thinks%20he%27s%20a%20woman%3F","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=A%20human%20boy%20who%20thinks%20he%27s%20a%20woman%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e5","summary":"In a flashback, sixteen-year-old Alesha kills her first dragon with a spear and names herself Alesha, her grandmother's name, before the old khan and the horde.","participants":["alesha-who-smiles-at-death","mardu"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"major","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":37,"quote":"she pulled a spear from a dead man's back and plunged it into the beast's mouth, up into its brain.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=she%20pulled%20a%20spear,up%20into%20its%20brain.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=she%20pulled%20a%20spear,up%20into%20its%20brain.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e6","summary":"In the flashback, the old khan and horde shout Alesha's name without hesitation.","participants":["alesha-who-smiles-at-death","mardu"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"major","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":43,"quote":"And the whole gathered horde shouted \"Alesha!\" in reply.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=And%20the%20whole%20gathered,shouted%20%22Alesha%21%22%20in%20reply.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=And%20the%20whole%20gathered,shouted%20%22Alesha%21%22%20in%20reply.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e7","summary":"Alesha kills another dragon with a swing of her sword while it lunges at the nameless orc, and tells him to show who he is.","participants":["alesha-who-smiles-at-death"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"major","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":47,"quote":"I know who I am,\" Alesha said to him, still smiling. \"Now show me who you are.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=I%20know%20who%20I,me%20who%20you%20are.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=I%20know%20who%20I,me%20who%20you%20are.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e8","summary":"The orc fights unorthodoxly, battering the dragon and making openings for allies, and the six dragons die at great cost.","participants":["mardu","kolaghan-s-brood"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"major","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":50,"quote":"Six of Kolaghan's brood would never prey on the Mardu again.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=Six%20of%20Kolaghan%27s%20brood,on%20the%20Mardu%20again.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=Six%20of%20Kolaghan%27s%20brood,on%20the%20Mardu%20again.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e9","summary":"After the battle, Alesha hears the warriors' deeds and shouts out each new war name.","participants":["alesha-who-smiles-at-death","mardu","woe-reapers","war-name"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"minor","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":52,"quote":"she shouted the name for the horde to hear—with never a moment's hesitation.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=she%20shouted%20the%20name,never%20a%20moment%27s%20hesitation.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=she%20shouted%20the%20name,never%20a%20moment%27s%20hesitation.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e10","summary":"Three warriors testify that the nameless orc saved their lives, and Alesha rebukes him for thinking his deeds are not glorious enough, telling him to learn his place before choosing a name.","participants":["alesha-who-smiles-at-death","kuru-vashar","magran-backbreaker","jalasha-impaler"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"major","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":73,"quote":"When you learn what your place among the Mardu is, then you can choose a name.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=When%20you%20learn%20what,can%20choose%20a%20name.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=When%20you%20learn%20what,can%20choose%20a%20name.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e11","summary":"The orc declares he knows Alesha and names her 'Alesha, Who Smiles at Death,' and the Mardu shout her name.","participants":["alesha-who-smiles-at-death","mardu"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"major","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":221,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":82,"quote":"and I call you Alesha, Who Smiles at Death.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tr